{"category_id":"6a5dd80467bf62345b1ba73f","label_id":[],"sort":7,"status":1,"type":"content","details":"<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">不止优质轴承产品供应，德国 GRONDE 格朗德所属企业是具备国际贸易、仓储物流、商品展销多功能的国际化运营主体，深耕工业配套领域多年，积累丰富行业服务经验。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">区别于传统单纯产品销售模式，企业搭建完整闭环服务体系，设立标准化销售服务、技术服务、售后服务团队，技术人才梯队配置完善，拥有多名高级技术人员与专业工程师。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">在售前阶段，工程师可根据设备工况、负载、环境条件提供轴承选型建议；售中跟进订单进度，依托成熟仓储物流保障及时交付；售后快速响应设备装配、故障排查、工况优化等各类技术难题，一站式解决客户轴承相关各类疑难问题。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">面向大型工矿企业、装备制造厂商，GRONDE 格朗德坚持 &ldquo;产品 + 技术&rdquo; 双输出，不只是轴承供应商，更是长期可靠的工业运转解决方案合作伙伴。<\/p>","title":"集贸易、仓储、服务于一体 GRONDE 格朗德打造一站式高端轴承综合服务平台","bg_img":"https:\/\/oss.lcweb01.cn\/jzt\/6a5d900c3b7c8a0bdb25998e\/image\/20260813\/d5cc0c3ddebc7d8192f5856d0c39bbfa.jpeg","intro":"不止优质轴承产品供应，德国 GRONDE 格朗德所属企业是具备国际贸易、仓储物流、商品展销多功能的国际化运营主体，深耕工业配套领域多年，积累丰富行业服务经验。","column_id":"6a5dd7b35ef06b193f2b9a3a","site_id":"6a5d900c3b7c8a0bdb25998e","is_top":0,"create_time":"2026-08-13 18:27:36","update_time":"2026-08-13 18:27:36","id":"6a7d9c1840fc4b0d535ded05","gl_list":[]}